{"id":"n62105-9-5","stage":1,"title":"밝다 · 懂礼貌","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62105-9-5-1","ko":"지수는 매일 아침 버스 기사 아저씨에게도 꼭 인사를 해요.","zh":"智秀每天早上都会跟公交车司机叔叔打招呼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"매일","meaning":"天天，每日","explanation":"매일：天天，每日","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58104","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기사","meaning":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","explanation":"기사：司机，驾驶员，操作员","readings":[{"term":"기사","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38269","senseId":"1","lemma":"기사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아저씨에게도","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인사를","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"天天，每日","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58104","definition":"每天都，无遗漏地。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1f896d183072b812","term":"기사","zh":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3","entryId":"38269","definition":"职业驾驶汽车或操作机械设备等的人。","pronunciation":["기사"]},{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"ae353e9482abc103","term":"인사","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3","entryId":"66311","definition":"见面或告别时表现地有礼节，或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["인사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e517c81dab87e4975fa3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62105-9-5-2","ko":"인사성이 아주 밝은 아이네요.","zh":"真是个非常热情有礼貌的孩子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"인사성이","meaning":"礼节，礼貌","explanation":"인사성：礼节，礼貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인사성","audio":"/audio/903325036a1a850dfd97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72902","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밝은","meaning":"懂礼貌","explanation":"밝다：懂礼貌；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"9","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이네요.","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"903325036a1a850d","term":"인사성","zh":"礼节，礼貌","audio":"/audio/903325036a1a850dfd97.mp3","entryId":"72902","definition":"得体地打招呼的性格或品质。","pronunciation":["인사썽"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"懂礼貌","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"礼仪端正。","pronunciation":["박따"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9b62759026193586be3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.227,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62105","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"9","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5672,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真是个非常热情有礼貌的孩子啊。","智秀每天早上都会跟公交车司机叔叔打招呼。","你们这些小偷，站住！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀每天早上都会跟公交车司机叔叔打招呼。","你们这些小偷，站住！","真是个非常热情有礼貌的孩子啊。"],"answer":2}]}
